    "tiers": "VM vCPU quota: limited 16 / new 32 / verified 256; a project becomes 'verified' automatically once an invoice over $5 is paid; above 256 via support@ubicloud.com. GitHub runner vCPU concurrency: limited 128 / new 300 / verified 300 (arm64 50/100/100). GPU VMs need a per-project feature flag granted by support.",
    "notes": "From the provider's official open-source repo (config/default_quotas.yml, model/invoice.rb, model/account.rb); not stated on the public docs pages. 32 vCPU = e.g. 16 x standard-2 or 32 x burstable-1.",
